1568..1641 Comment "/// The law below a second restriction, sending on the outer channel: the"
1642..1719 Comment "/// occurrence counts past one abstraction to its binder and the law\'s counts"
1720..1796 Comment "/// past none, so the law does not apply; the normal form names each atom by"
1797..1811 Comment "/// its depth."
