2610..2678 Comment "/// Scope extrusion where `out` takes a channel: `q` moves under the"
2679..2757 Comment "/// restriction stated fresh for it, so the rule counts each channel `q` names"
2758..2835 Comment "/// one abstraction further, and the outer channel stays the one sent on. The"
2836..2914 Comment "/// kernel replays the verdict with the rule conditioned, in no critical pair."
